sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Staff
  participant X as "orders.updateStatus"
  participant AI as GROQ action
  participant C as Customer UI

  S->>X: Mark order ready
  X->>X: Patch order status
  X->>AI: Trigger notify (userId, order)
  AI->>AI: Build context + GROQ message
  AI-->>C: Toast + chat: Hey Name, order X is ready!
